<title>HONG KONG: Beauforte 1996 profit rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Beauforte 1996 profit rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  179.0     vs 53.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   85.0	vs 85.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 10.8 gain vs 13.1 gain</p>
<p>    Net			   52.3	vs 15.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		    72.7	vs 70.3</p>
<p>    Company name		Beauforte Investors Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 May 16-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  May 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Beauforte is an investment holding company with subsidiaries engaged in shipowning, property and investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on disposal of certain investment property whereas that for the preceding year represented mainly profit arising on the disposal of certain long-term investments.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 110 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 25 cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
